  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap HL70278ToAppointmentStatus</b></p><a name=\"HL70278ToAppointmentStatus\"> </a><a name=\"hcHL70278ToAppointmentStatus\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0278.html\">fillerStatus</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-appointmentstatus.html\">AppointmentStatus</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Pending</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>pending</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Waitlist</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>waitlist (Waitlisted)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Booked</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>booked</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Started</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td>arrived</td><td>Judgement call: the patient has arrived and the appointment has started.</td></tr><tr><td>Complete</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>fulfilled</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Cancelled</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>cancelled</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Discontinued</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>cancelled</td><td>v2.3+ code. Discontinued is treated as cancelled; the HL7 v2-to-FHIR IG leaves it unmapped.</td></tr><tr><td>DC (Discontinued)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>cancelled</td><td>v2.9+ code for Discontinued; treated as cancelled.</td></tr><tr><td>Deleted</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td>entered-in-error</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Blocked</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td>booked</td><td>No FHIR equivalent; the time is held so it is treated as booked.</td></tr><tr><td>Overbook</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>booked</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Noshow</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>noshow</td><td/></tr></table></div>"
